{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013320/extras/dfbb78283381f0c99cd1c88a762fff7d.avif?t=1760979572\" width=576 height=243 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LUST HAREM: 1001 Pleasures</strong> \ud83d\udc9e \u2014 an erotic visual novel where power, betrayal, and passion collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013320/extras/4b0add8b3697a78ebfb783f6101a7c9a.avif?t=1760979572\" width=540 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Framed during your own coronation, you are cast aside by your disappointed father and sent to a forsaken province where the former ruler has perished. Here, you must prove your worth and reclaim your place in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013320/extras/3d38f206872010896ddaf697442943d9.poster.avif?t=1760979572\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013320/extras/3d38f206872010896ddaf697442943d9.webm?t=1760979572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013320/extras/3d38f206872010896ddaf697442943d9.mp4?t=1760979572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>At your side stands Selina, loyal and supportive, while a cunning priest watches your every step, waiting for a chance to see you fail. Upon arriving at the fallen lord\u2019s mansion, you discover not only ruins of authority but also two enchanting women from his harem. Having survived the tragedy, they kept the province in balance \u2014 and now, they may become your weakness\u2026 or your greatest strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013320/extras/226f48df2d032ad271ff74dc0533dca6.poster.avif?t=1760979572\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013320/extras/226f48df2d032ad271ff74dc0533dca6.webm?t=1760979572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013320/extras/226f48df2d032ad271ff74dc0533dca6.mp4?t=1760979572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your own harem built on loyalty, talent, and desire. Rule with both power and pleasure, and uncover whether you can truly handle the 1001 pleasures that await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013320/extras/f0094087e350566175cc8c48d44fdd8d.poster.avif?t=1760979572\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013320/extras/f0094087e350566175cc8c48d44fdd8d.webm?t=1760979572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013320/extras/f0094087e350566175cc8c48d44fdd8d.mp4?t=1760979572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013320/extras/85a75be0d4e4b7c54d0ea6af2c27a356.avif?t=1760979572\" width=502 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <